  "body": "### Summary\nAs a member reading a poll I have not answered, I want \"Voir les résultats\" with a warning that I will not be able to vote afterwards, so that I can see the results without voting, as in the published app.\n\nMilestone: M4 (operator, 2026-11-08). Found by the `2440d79..2fe43da3` sweep of #655 (row `c7693a88`), opened by its catch-up pass.\n\n### Legacy @ `2fe43da3` (`legacy/duo-inner-cover`, #372)\n- The poll sheet of a votable poll has a \"Voir les résultats\" button (`HFRswift/Swift/PollView.swift:258`); it asks first: alert \"Voir les résultats ?\", \"Annuler\" / \"Voir les résultats\" (destructive), message \"Le forum indique qu'après cette action, vous ne pourrez plus voter à ce sondage.\" (`:167-174`).\n- Confirmed, it POSTs the poll form to `user/vote.php?config=hfr.inc` with the form's hidden fields and `sondage_submit=Voir les résultats` (`PollData.swift:45-80`, `PollViewModel.showResults`, `PollView.swift:54-63`), then reloads the poll and shows the results.\n\n### Current SwiftHFR\nLOT-136 (#226) shows the poll and votes; there is no \"Voir les résultats\" on a votable poll.\n\n### Scope\n- The button, its confirmation and the write, through the poll flow of LOT-054 / LOT-136 (session checked first, success only on HFR's own answer, `unconfirmed` never resent, LOT-048).\n- **Pending capture first** (`host: mac`, never hand-built, LESSONS 36): HFR's answer to `sondage_submit=Voir les résultats` and the poll page after it, on a test account and a throwaway poll. Without it the entry stays off.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- Shown only on a votable poll; the confirmation text as legacy; after it, the results are shown and the vote is no longer offered.\n- Tests on the captured answers with a loopback-only session (`hosts: .exactHost`).\n\n\n\n### Blocked by\n\nnothing: the capture is merged (#1045: `R684a`, `W684`, `R684b`)\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
