   "body": "**mac/M1: the capture needs your go first (a state-changing write)**\n\nWhat it does: one POST to `user/vote.php?config=hfr.inc` with the poll form's hidden fields and `sondage_submit=Voir les résultats` (`PollData.swift:45-80` @ 2fe43da3), through `tooling/fixtures/flows.py` (shared delay, request budget), then one GET of the poll page after it. The account then **can no longer vote on that poll**: HFR says so, and that is the point of the capture.\n\nI need from you:\n- the poll: a topic with a votable poll that the account has not answered and does not care about (a throwaway poll on a test topic is ideal);\n- the account: one of your two capture accounts.\n\nThen: capture, anonymize per FIXTURES.md with an independent leak check, a capture PR, and `status: ready` here with « Unblocked by #PR ».\n\nDecision needed (operator)\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
