   "body": "Unblocked by #1045 (merged as 0f1f1c334abb289fb667f149555ecd66374bc5c4).\n\nWhat the port can rely on (HFR-PROTOCOL §5 \"Poll results\" and §6c LOT-054):\n- the votable form carries two submits; HFR's own text under them: 'Attention si vous cliquez sur \"voir les résultats\" vous ne pourrez plus voter' (`R684a`);\n- the POST (form order, no `reponse`, `sondage_submit=Voir les résultats`) is answered with **the vote's own sentence** and the refresh to page 1 (`W684`), so `.pollVote` classifies it as a success, and the client knows which submit it sent;\n- the page after shows the results block and no form (`R684b`).\n\nmac/M1 releases its claim (the port is not Mac work):\n/release mac/M1\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
